WEBVTT

00:01:32.070 --> 00:01:34.520
- - Godai, bottoms up!
- - Chug it! Chug it!

00:01:36.060 --> 00:01:36.880
Mitaka           Yotsuya

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:39.100
Ichinose

00:01:41.070 --> 00:01:41.620
l love you!

00:01:43.400 --> 00:01:44.510
- - Chug-a-lug! Chug-a-lug!
- - Godai, calm down!

00:01:44.740 --> 00:01:45.560
Calm down!

00:01:46.070 --> 00:01:48.850
After that, things
between Kyoko and l...

00:01:49.410 --> 00:01:50.490
Hey! Hey! Hey!

00:01:50.740 --> 00:01:52.520
KYOKO!

00:01:54.410 --> 00:01:55.610
it was two days later...

00:01:57.750 --> 00:01:58.420
Y-Yes?

00:02:01.750 --> 00:02:03.620
Godai, thank you so much!

00:02:04.420 --> 00:02:06.290
To tell the truth
I was shocked!

00:02:06.760 --> 00:02:11.300
I never expected her to accept
my declaration of love so easily.

00:02:12.430 --> 00:02:15.210
I hear Ikuko got a 92%
on an English test.

00:02:15.770 --> 00:02:17.000
Oh. That.

00:02:17.100 --> 00:02:19.240
Why didn't you
tell me sooner?

00:02:20.770 --> 00:02:23.580
Thanks for tutoring her.
Keep up the good work.

00:02:25.440 --> 00:02:26.110
O-Okay!

00:02:26.450 --> 00:02:29.850
In any case, I'm not in
the doghouse anymore.

00:02:47.470 --> 00:02:48.780
Ichijoji Liquor Shop

00:02:49.140 --> 00:02:51.660
- - Where do I deliver it?
- - Let's see...

00:02:52.140 --> 00:02:53.870
The Oba family
on 2-Chome.

00:03:04.480 --> 00:03:05.650
It's hot!

00:03:06.820 --> 00:03:08.130
It's really hot!

00:03:19.160 --> 00:03:20.740
Great to be a kid.
One long vacation.

00:03:21.170 --> 00:03:24.300
Don't give me that!
Kids got worries, too!

00:03:24.840 --> 00:03:25.980
What the heck?

00:03:30.840 --> 00:03:31.950
Nezame Public Bath

00:03:40.190 --> 00:03:41.480
Where's my shampoo?

00:03:41.850 --> 00:03:43.250
Oh no, I forgot it!

00:03:45.860 --> 00:03:46.730
Use mine.

00:03:48.530 --> 00:03:50.020
T-Thank you!

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:54.490
We're sure crossing
paths a lot today.

00:03:56.870 --> 00:03:58.330
What's wrong?
You're looking down.

00:03:59.200 --> 00:04:01.010
It's summer vacation...

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:04.400
I'm miserable.

00:04:07.880 --> 00:04:12.830
We got this assignment to draw
a picture of our summer trip.

00:04:13.550 --> 00:04:18.500
But you know Mom. And Dad is
always too tired to do anything.

00:04:19.890 --> 00:04:21.590
You've got a dad?

00:04:22.230 --> 00:04:25.040
Yeah, more or less.

00:04:25.900 --> 00:04:28.530
I remember when
I was a kid.

00:04:29.570 --> 00:04:31.760
We got homework
just like that.

00:04:32.240 --> 00:04:34.930
Draw a map of wherever
you go on vacation.

00:04:35.570 --> 00:04:39.080
Kids who didn't go anywhere had
to make up a research project.

00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:43.000
My family runs
a restaurant.

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:46.970
Even when I was a kid
I still had to help out.

00:05:05.940 --> 00:05:08.520
Godai's the only one who
did the research project!

00:05:09.610 --> 00:05:11.660
- - What's this?
- - How weird!

00:05:13.610 --> 00:05:15.630
I was miserable, really...

00:05:16.620 --> 00:05:20.660
That teacher didn't care how
embarrassing it was. I hated her.

00:05:24.290 --> 00:05:27.890
So they're still giving
out homework like that.

00:05:28.960 --> 00:05:31.070
I gotta warn you,
it can be real torture!

00:05:32.970 --> 00:05:34.640
l hate this.

00:05:34.970 --> 00:05:37.520
It's all my family's fault.
I'll probably end up a delinquent.

00:05:38.300 --> 00:05:39.320
Wanna go to
the beach?

00:05:40.640 --> 00:05:43.300
Really? You'd
really take me?

00:05:50.650 --> 00:05:51.320
Mom!

00:05:51.320 --> 00:05:53.220
- - Mom! Mom! Mom!
- - What is it?

00:05:53.650 --> 00:05:55.260
Listen, Big Brother is...

00:05:55.650 --> 00:05:56.790
What ''Big Brother''?

00:05:57.660 --> 00:06:00.180
Big Brother Godai
who I like sooo much!

00:06:01.330 --> 00:06:03.700
He said he's gonna take me
to the beach!

00:06:04.660 --> 00:06:06.410
Please! Can I go with him?

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:08.460
I'm so happy for you, Kentaro.

00:06:08.670 --> 00:06:10.100
Come along, Manager!

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:14.750
Yeah! I won't be so worried
with you along.

00:06:15.340 --> 00:06:17.710
The more the merrier.
Come on!

00:06:18.010 --> 00:06:19.090
I don't know...

00:06:19.680 --> 00:06:20.760
Come on!

00:06:21.010 --> 00:06:22.000
I don't know...

00:06:22.010 --> 00:06:23.180
Come on!

00:06:24.350 --> 00:06:25.640
Come on! Come on!

00:06:26.020 --> 00:06:28.100
Come on! Come on!
Come on! Come on! Come on!

00:06:30.020 --> 00:06:31.220
Okay, I'll go!

00:06:31.690 --> 00:06:32.890
All right!

00:06:35.360 --> 00:06:36.360
- - All right! All right!
- - All right! All right!

00:06:36.360 --> 00:06:38.350
- - She's coming with us!
- - This is great!

00:06:38.700 --> 00:06:39.630
All right! All right!

00:06:58.720 --> 00:06:59.330
Kyoko...

00:06:59.720 --> 00:07:01.680
What a fascinating
preoccupation.

00:07:03.060 --> 00:07:06.250
Such exhilaration from
embracing one's own swim trunks.

00:07:12.060 --> 00:07:13.580
Get out, you deviant!

00:07:25.740 --> 00:07:27.580
W-Why does it
turn out this way?

00:07:27.750 --> 00:07:29.620
Teach me how
to swim, please?

00:07:30.080 --> 00:07:31.040
S-Sure...

00:07:31.750 --> 00:07:34.710
I'm sorry! I mentioned it,
and she insisted!

00:07:35.420 --> 00:07:37.730
I don't mind Ikuko...

00:07:42.090 --> 00:07:43.960
Calling him was
your idea, wasn't it?

00:07:44.430 --> 00:07:46.830
To save you train fare,
Mr. Penniless Student.

00:07:47.100 --> 00:07:48.770
Sorry. I know you're busy...

00:07:49.100 --> 00:07:52.410
I was just thinking how
nice a swim would be.

00:07:53.440 --> 00:07:54.370
Hello!

00:07:54.440 --> 00:07:55.430
Hi!

00:07:55.770 --> 00:07:58.200
Weekdays at the beach?
Is business that slow?

00:07:58.780 --> 00:08:01.440
I'm not 9 to 5, so my
schedule is flexible.

00:08:01.780 --> 00:08:03.970
Not as flexible
as a student, though.

00:08:04.450 --> 00:08:06.730
Not really. part-time
work keeps me busy.

00:08:07.120 --> 00:08:09.750
I see. You finally
decided to buy a bike?

00:08:10.790 --> 00:08:12.370
Nothing so frivolous.

00:08:12.790 --> 00:08:13.960
Just earning my keep!

00:08:14.460 --> 00:08:16.210
A rare statement, nowadays.

00:08:16.800 --> 00:08:18.380
it must be rough.

00:08:18.800 --> 00:08:21.110
Suffering builds
character in youth.

00:08:21.470 --> 00:08:22.780
And I'm still...

00:08:22.800 --> 00:08:24.200
...YOUNG...

00:08:24.470 --> 00:08:25.370
...after all!

00:08:26.140 --> 00:08:26.780
Youth is...

00:08:27.140 --> 00:08:28.220
...the ONE thing...

00:08:28.470 --> 00:08:29.320
...you've got on me!

00:08:29.810 --> 00:08:31.770
Well, youth is potential,
so they say!

00:08:34.480 --> 00:08:37.910
How pathetic. Hiding
behind his bleak future.

00:08:41.820 --> 00:08:42.580
I'm off!

00:08:43.160 --> 00:08:44.680
Have a safe trip!

00:08:45.160 --> 00:08:46.450
See you later!

00:08:49.830 --> 00:08:52.410
Come. Home. Soon.

00:09:30.870 --> 00:09:33.240
''What a fool I am! ''

00:09:33.870 --> 00:09:36.210
''Oh, such a fool am l! ''

00:09:39.210 --> 00:09:40.940
There isn't much traffic!

00:09:41.550 --> 00:09:44.070
At this rate, we'll be
there in two hours.

00:09:52.890 --> 00:09:54.230
What is a dog
doing in here?

00:09:57.560 --> 00:09:59.200
We hatched the scheme!

00:09:59.900 --> 00:10:01.570
What have you done!?

00:10:01.900 --> 00:10:04.510
But Soichiro wants
to go swimming, too!

00:10:05.240 --> 00:10:07.580
This is bad!
We're over-passengered!

00:10:08.240 --> 00:10:09.730
We can't drop
him off here!

00:10:09.910 --> 00:10:12.600
I don't think they
count dogs as passengers.

00:10:14.580 --> 00:10:15.890
T-This is bad.

00:10:17.580 --> 00:10:20.300
Hey! What are we
stopping here for?

00:10:20.590 --> 00:10:22.050
Driving is hard work!

00:10:23.260 --> 00:10:25.950
You're looking pretty green.

00:10:26.590 --> 00:10:28.370
I'll be okay in a minute.

00:10:28.590 --> 00:10:30.810
Maybe we should
turn back.

00:10:31.260 --> 00:10:32.780
N-No! I'm fine!

00:10:33.270 --> 00:10:35.230
Ms. Otonashi, please
go back to the car.

00:10:35.270 --> 00:10:37.230
I'd like to talk
to Godai a moment.

00:10:39.610 --> 00:10:40.280
B-But...

00:10:40.610 --> 00:10:42.830
Don't worry.
I'll be along shortly!

00:10:46.280 --> 00:10:48.330
He wants to finish
this here and now!

00:10:49.280 --> 00:10:50.570
I'm ready for him!

00:10:57.290 --> 00:10:59.600
Godai, do you know
how to drive?

00:11:00.630 --> 00:11:02.850
Well!? Can you
or can't you!?

00:11:04.300 --> 00:11:05.760
If it's a bike...

00:11:05.960 --> 00:11:07.740
- - It's hopeless...
- - What is wrong with you?

00:11:08.970 --> 00:11:09.960
That.

00:11:15.640 --> 00:11:16.510
You mean the dog?

00:11:16.640 --> 00:11:18.010
Right, the dog!

00:11:18.640 --> 00:11:20.310
Y-You're afraid
of dogs?

00:11:20.650 --> 00:11:22.260
Ever since a
childhood incident.

00:11:24.980 --> 00:11:26.730
it isn't funny!

00:11:27.650 --> 00:11:29.700
I'm the driver.

00:11:31.660 --> 00:11:33.410
You're right, this is bad.

00:11:36.660 --> 00:11:39.880
- - Coach Mitaka, you look pale again.
- - l-I'm fine!

00:12:02.350 --> 00:12:05.660
Soichiro, I may be
joining you soon!

00:12:49.740 --> 00:12:51.260
It's wonderful to be alive!

00:12:51.740 --> 00:12:54.050
I'm sorry for
the rough ride.

00:12:54.410 --> 00:12:56.460
Really! We thought
we were gonna die!

00:12:57.740 --> 00:12:58.760
That's not what I meant...

00:12:59.080 --> 00:13:00.250
Big Brother, let's go!

00:13:00.410 --> 00:13:01.260
Let's go! Let's go!

00:13:01.750 --> 00:13:03.270
Manager,
come with us!

00:13:03.750 --> 00:13:04.510
B-But...

00:13:07.090 --> 00:13:09.400
I'll just rest
up here a bit.

00:13:09.760 --> 00:13:10.840
Have fun!

00:13:12.420 --> 00:13:13.850
He looks so...Fragile.

00:13:21.770 --> 00:13:24.110
G-Godai! Godai!

00:13:24.440 --> 00:13:25.430
What's up?

00:13:25.770 --> 00:13:27.440
Take the dog with you.

00:13:28.440 --> 00:13:29.430
Why not?

00:13:30.440 --> 00:13:31.900
Gotta be chivalrous.

00:13:32.110 --> 00:13:33.630
C'mon, Soichiro! C'mon!

00:13:36.110 --> 00:13:38.630
Soichiro has fallen
for you, Coach Mitaka.

00:13:41.120 --> 00:13:42.760
He's becoming
attached to you!

00:13:42.790 --> 00:13:45.750
Once Soichiro is attached
he'll never be separated.

00:13:48.460 --> 00:13:51.560
C'mon, Soichiro!
I'll carry you!

00:14:02.810 --> 00:14:04.920
I'm sorry, Godai.
He must be heavy!

00:14:05.140 --> 00:14:06.450
Not at all.

00:14:07.150 --> 00:14:10.550
As long I've got the dog,
Mitaka can't come near us!

00:14:10.820 --> 00:14:12.080
It's my chance!

00:14:16.820 --> 00:14:18.080
l spoke too soon.

00:14:18.820 --> 00:14:21.130
Kentaro, watch
Soichiro for a while?

00:14:21.490 --> 00:14:22.250
O-Okay!

00:14:22.490 --> 00:14:24.920
W-Where are you
going, Manager?

00:14:26.160 --> 00:14:27.450
A little further out.

00:14:27.830 --> 00:14:29.880
W-Will she be okay
out there alone?

00:14:30.500 --> 00:14:32.430
Auntie Kyoko's a
great swimmer!

00:14:32.500 --> 00:14:35.400
But you never know
what could happen!

00:15:03.200 --> 00:15:05.220
It's been years since I've
gone swimming in the ocean.

00:15:06.870 --> 00:15:08.160
it Feels so good!

00:15:16.880 --> 00:15:18.930
Manager,
is something wrong?

00:15:20.220 --> 00:15:21.210
As if he
doesn't know!

00:15:21.220 --> 00:15:22.890
Women shouldn't
swim alone.

00:15:23.220 --> 00:15:25.180
There are weird
men everywhere.

00:15:25.890 --> 00:15:26.820
Look who's talking!

00:15:27.230 --> 00:15:28.160
Manager!

00:15:30.900 --> 00:15:32.130
How dare he...

00:15:32.230 --> 00:15:33.870
Just because I'm a
widow doesn't mean...

00:15:35.570 --> 00:15:36.470
Godai!

00:15:38.570 --> 00:15:40.590
Listen here, Godai!

00:15:40.910 --> 00:15:44.450
I may be a widow, and a
little bit worldly, but...

00:15:45.580 --> 00:15:46.280
Huh?

00:15:46.580 --> 00:15:47.370
But that doesn't mean...

00:15:50.920 --> 00:15:52.030
Jellyfish!

00:15:52.920 --> 00:15:54.000
J-Jellyfish?

00:15:54.250 --> 00:15:56.940
U-Uh oh. Y-You mean it
was jellyfish that...

00:15:58.920 --> 00:16:00.150
I see!

00:16:01.590 --> 00:16:02.610
I...

00:16:02.930 --> 00:16:06.180
I get the picture.
That's the kind of guy you think I am.

00:16:06.600 --> 00:16:07.910
G-Godai...

00:16:08.270 --> 00:16:10.260
Enjoy your swim
all alone!

00:16:10.600 --> 00:16:12.650
I guess I'm
just a weirdo!

00:16:13.270 --> 00:16:14.560
I'm sorry...

00:16:16.610 --> 00:16:18.130
I'm so sorry, Godai!

00:16:18.280 --> 00:16:19.180
Forget it!

00:16:19.280 --> 00:16:21.800
I can't.
You're angry with me!

00:16:22.280 --> 00:16:23.420
Forget it! Forget it!

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:25.370
Godai, wait up!

00:16:25.620 --> 00:16:27.430
- -I'm not angry!
- -Godai!

00:16:29.620 --> 00:16:30.580
Hey, babe!

00:16:30.960 --> 00:16:31.980
Wanna lift?

00:16:32.290 --> 00:16:34.840
Your boyfriend
doesn't deserve you.

00:16:35.290 --> 00:16:36.220
B-Boy...

00:16:36.630 --> 00:16:37.590
B-Boy- - f...

00:16:37.630 --> 00:16:38.560
B-Boy- - f-friend.

00:16:40.300 --> 00:16:41.760
Let's go back
to the beach!

00:16:42.300 --> 00:16:44.580
- - Shoot!
- - Struck out again.

00:16:50.980 --> 00:16:52.470
Is he still
angry with me?

00:16:52.640 --> 00:16:54.480
I hate the
silent treatment.

00:16:56.310 --> 00:16:57.270
Manager!

00:16:59.320 --> 00:17:01.900
Do we really look
like a couple?

00:17:03.320 --> 00:17:04.780
I love the ocean!

00:17:06.320 --> 00:17:07.930
He sure doesn't
hold a grudge long.

00:17:19.000 --> 00:17:22.020
H-Help! H- -

00:17:23.340 --> 00:17:25.390
Look at that!
What a dweeb!

00:17:25.680 --> 00:17:27.200
What are you doing?

00:17:28.680 --> 00:17:29.910
Soichiro! Come here!

00:17:30.010 --> 00:17:31.150
Let's play in the sand!

00:17:33.690 --> 00:17:35.620
Hello ladies
come here ofte!n?

00:17:41.360 --> 00:17:41.880
Here!

00:17:42.030 --> 00:17:45.160
Coach Mitaka, are you
feeling better now?

00:17:45.700 --> 00:17:47.750
Completely recovered.

00:17:48.370 --> 00:17:51.390
Sorry ladies.
My companions are back, so...

00:17:52.040 --> 00:17:54.530
We're staying at
that hotel over there!

00:17:55.040 --> 00:17:56.880
Come and see us tonight!

00:17:58.040 --> 00:18:00.090
I'm just a daytripper,
sorry to say.

00:18:01.380 --> 00:18:02.460
You're no fun!

00:18:06.380 --> 00:18:07.670
You're certainly
popular with the girls.

00:18:08.720 --> 00:18:11.120
Ladies always seem to
take advantage of me.

00:18:14.390 --> 00:18:15.700
Care for a boat ride?

00:18:16.730 --> 00:18:17.660
S-Sure...

00:18:19.400 --> 00:18:20.420
We'd love to!

00:18:29.740 --> 00:18:30.380
Hey!

00:18:30.410 --> 00:18:32.400
Adults only?
That's no fair!

00:18:32.740 --> 00:18:34.790
I'm sorry.
We'll be back soon!

00:18:46.760 --> 00:18:47.690
What a beautiful view!

00:18:50.760 --> 00:18:51.930
What an ugly view.

00:18:52.100 --> 00:18:53.090
I second that.

00:18:57.100 --> 00:19:00.290
Ms. Otonashi, shall I teach
you how to row a boat?

00:19:01.110 --> 00:19:03.540
it sounds interesting,
but I'm not sure...

00:19:03.790 --> 00:19:04.740
You'll be fine.

00:19:05.110 --> 00:19:06.950
Just come sit next to me.

00:19:07.450 --> 00:19:08.180
B-But...

00:19:08.790 --> 00:19:10.860
You'll master it in no time.

00:19:11.120 --> 00:19:12.410
Okay, but just
for a little while.

00:19:14.450 --> 00:19:15.500
Why that lousy...

00:19:16.450 --> 00:19:18.120
Take the oar
with both hands.

00:19:18.790 --> 00:19:19.720
Like this?

00:19:20.460 --> 00:19:22.330
Your grip is slightly off.

00:19:23.130 --> 00:19:24.150
Hold it like this.

00:19:25.130 --> 00:19:28.170
He's acting like
I'm not even here!

00:19:29.810 --> 00:19:31.090
Drop the oar
down a little...

00:19:32.140 --> 00:19:33.100
L-Like this?

00:19:33.810 --> 00:19:35.860
No, a little
further down, like...

00:19:36.810 --> 00:19:37.270
Woof!

00:19:43.480 --> 00:19:44.710
Where's the rubber raft?

00:19:45.150 --> 00:19:46.760
Soichiro is gone!

00:19:47.490 --> 00:19:49.450
- - Soichiro!
- - Soichiro!

00:19:49.820 --> 00:19:51.520
- - Soichiro!
- - Soichiro!

00:20:01.500 --> 00:20:02.990
Is something wrong?

00:20:03.500 --> 00:20:05.870
I thought I just
heard Soichiro calling...

00:20:07.840 --> 00:20:08.630
G-Godai!

00:20:08.840 --> 00:20:11.360
What!? This time
it wasn't me!

00:20:15.510 --> 00:20:16.560
Soichiro!

00:20:17.180 --> 00:20:19.460
- - He'll drift out to sea!
- - All right! Wait here!

00:20:20.850 --> 00:20:21.610
Godai!

00:20:21.850 --> 00:20:24.020
Coach Mitaka
move the boat clos!er...

00:20:24.520 --> 00:20:26.570
O-Okay.

00:20:27.540 --> 00:20:29.700
Good boy!
You're okay now!

00:20:30.200 --> 00:20:30.930
Godai...

00:20:31.200 --> 00:20:32.750
I'll put
Soichiro aboard!

00:20:33.200 --> 00:20:34.060
Please do!

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:37.960
Here, Mitaka!

00:20:42.540 --> 00:20:44.240
Thank you so much, Godai!

00:20:44.880 --> 00:20:45.730
No problem!

00:20:45.880 --> 00:20:47.870
I'll head back
to the beach.

00:20:48.210 --> 00:20:50.140
It's in your hands,
Coach Mitaka.

00:20:50.880 --> 00:20:52.290
G-Godai...

00:20:52.560 --> 00:20:54.540
Maybe I could
take the raft.

00:20:55.560 --> 00:20:56.810
Did you say something?

00:20:57.220 --> 00:21:00.180
N-Nothing...

00:21:06.900 --> 00:21:08.630
Are you feeling
sick again?

00:21:08.900 --> 00:21:11.120
You're hopeless.
Seasick on a rowboat!

00:21:11.570 --> 00:21:12.620
S-Sorry...

00:21:12.900 --> 00:21:14.980
We should leave
before it gets dark.

00:21:15.240 --> 00:21:17.430
And I'm worried
about Maison Ikkoku.

00:21:17.910 --> 00:21:19.430
Let's go!
I'm fine now!

00:21:25.580 --> 00:21:27.330
You're not quite recovered.

00:21:28.250 --> 00:21:29.240
So- -

00:21:29.250 --> 00:21:30.560
Sorry.

00:21:32.920 --> 00:21:33.790
Well...

00:21:34.260 --> 00:21:36.950
Would you mind
if I drove?

00:21:43.600 --> 00:21:46.590
I had no idea that you
held a driver's license.

00:21:47.270 --> 00:21:50.490
I haven't driven
since I got it.

00:21:52.290 --> 00:21:53.890
I wonder if I'm up to it?

00:21:54.290 --> 00:21:56.770
I can never see
the side-view mirrors.

00:21:58.290 --> 00:22:00.890
Then I'll sit next
to you and navigate!

00:22:01.950 --> 00:22:05.430
Doesn't the passenger seat
have the most fatalities?

00:22:06.960 --> 00:22:09.710
To die at your hand
would be an honor.

00:22:15.310 --> 00:22:17.820
Everyone!
Fasten your seatbelts!

00:22:18.310 --> 00:22:18.970
Yes, Ma'am!

00:22:22.310 --> 00:22:23.570
Engine: Start!

00:22:46.000 --> 00:22:46.990
I- - I- - I'm driving!

00:22:47.330 --> 00:22:49.040
Ms. Otonashi, slow down!

00:22:49.330 --> 00:22:50.320
Manager!

00:22:50.340 --> 00:22:52.150
Quiet!
I'm concentrating!

00:22:54.670 --> 00:22:56.790
- - We're going so fast!
- - What a ride!

00:23:02.010 --> 00:23:06.640
My manager drove like a guy.
She passed so many cars.

00:23:11.020 --> 00:23:13.570
Ikuko and me had
lots of fun, but...

00:23:14.040 --> 00:23:17.980
Big Brother Godai' and Tennis
Coach Mitaka seemed nervous.

00:23:49.730 --> 00:23:50.990
Here's a question!

00:23:51.060 --> 00:23:55.290
What makes your heart ache, and
tastes both sour and sweet?

00:23:56.400 --> 00:23:57.710
Your first love, of course!

00:23:58.400 --> 00:24:02.000
Next: ''Kentaro's First Love!
What's Age Got to Do With It?''

00:24:02.740 --> 00:24:06.020
Kentaro's so precocious.
Who could be his first love?
